 * Revision 1.87  2008/03/04 18:46:38  torer
 * Testing bag semantics for OR
 *
 * Revision 1.86  2007/11/04 17:06:18  torer
 * Memory corruption in function PROCCALL
 *
 * Revision 1.85  2007/10/30 12:39:25  torer
 * Testing apply
 *
 * Revision 1.84  2007/10/11 12:23:32  torer
 * Predicate functions could not be used in select clauses
 *
 * Revision 1.83  2007/10/10 06:50:43  torer
 * Removed test for - on strings
