 * Revision 1.82  2007/10/09 19:01:33  torer
 * String - not commutative
 *
 * Revision 1.81  2007/10/09 18:19:15  torer
 * Invertible string concatenation
 *
 * Revision 1.80  2007/10/08 09:49:12  torer
 * Testing invertability of OID_NR
 *
 * Revision 1.79  2007/09/15 20:49:26  torer
 * Testing casting under aggregation
 *
 * Revision 1.78  2007/05/29 17:44:48  torer
 * remove f(x)=<y,z> ... now works
