 * Revision 1.77  2007/03/11 17:11:04  torer
 * Clear error message when doing illegal update
 *
 * Revision 1.76  2007/02/18 10:22:38  torer
 * SQRT(x) now returns only the positive root rather than both roots
 *
 * Revision 1.75  2007/01/07 00:26:43  torer
