	    ((sorttuples(osql "allpersons();")) '(("Tore") ("Ulla")))
	    ((osql "allstudents();") '(("Ulla")))
	    ((null (osql "select p from Person p;")) nil) 
	    )
:osql

create function p (integer x,integer y,integer z) -> boolean
		 as x=3 and z= x * y;

create function eqvars(Number x)->(Number,Number)
  as select y,y from Number y where y in iota(1,x);

lisp;

(checkequal "Ravi's example"		; LDL cannot handle ???
	    ((osql "select x,y,z from integer x,integer y,integer z
			 where y = 2 * x and p(x,y,z);")
	     '((3 6 18)))
	    ((osql "select x,y,z from integer x,integer y,integer z
			 where p(x,y,z) and y = 2 * x;")
	     '((3 6 18))))

(checkequal "equality simplifications"
	    ((osql "select x,y from integer x,integer y
			 where x = 1 and x = y;") '((1 1)))
	    ((osql "select x,y from integer x,integer y
			 where x = y and y = 1;") '((1 1)))
	    ((osql "select x,y from integer x,integer y
			 where x = 1 and y = 2 and x = y;") nil)
	    ((osql "select x,y from integer x,integer y
			 where x = y and x = 1 and y = 2;") nil)
	    ((osql "select x,y from integer x,integer y
			 where x = 1 and y = 1 and x = y;") '((1 1)))
	    ((osql "select x,y from integer x,integer y
			 where y = 2 and (x = 1 or x = 2) and x > 0;")
